#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:82
#: 98b1eebc1fb2452eab49613eb159416b
msgid "Safety"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:84
#: 083a63c134f948cfb19083b4f1b6147c
msgid "Operating a powered vehicle of any kind can be a lot of fun. However, nothing will ruin your day at the park more quickly than an accident or running afoul of the law. Since we want you to have a great experience, please make sure that you do all of the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:88
#: 8896e67e60be4c678b0c2a3df68a70b0
msgid "Operate within all local laws and regulations. For example, in the United States, current regulations require you to operate most UAVs under 400 foot above ground level, within line of site, and away from obstructions and populated areas. Since these regulations vary from place to place, even within the same country, ensure that you understand what you need to do to stay compliant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:93
#: caa023344d7e4f8db7be5b34a168f93b
msgid "Never operate the vehicle or software in a way that could be dangerous to you, other people, or property. Propellers, while rotating, could easily cut you; if a UAV fell on a person or object, it could cause injury; a UAV caught in power lines could cause an outage. As Ben Franklin said, “An ounce of prevention is worth a pound of cure.”"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:97
#: 7f73f9533c2b458e97802d3baa5f87f0
msgid "Always keep in mind that software and hardware failures happen. Although we design our products to minimize such issues, you should always operate with the understanding that a failure could occur at any point of time and without warning. As such, you should take the appropriate precautions to minimize danger in case of failure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_firmware.rst:101
#: 83eb32c8288a4f61b8fc86aba8fc7533
msgid "Never use the software or hardware for manned vehicles. The software and hardware we provide is only for use in unmanned vehicles."
msgstr ""
